WEBVTT

00:05:29.076 --> 00:05:33.716
but also because of the power
of the fossil fuel industry.

00:05:34.836 --> 00:05:40.356
The influence of the industry,
who no longer deny climate change.

00:05:40.876 --> 00:05:45.076
But they have moved
from denial to delusion:

00:05:46.516 --> 00:05:51.076
that technologies
that are not yet proven at scale,

00:05:51.076 --> 00:05:55.196
that are not yet cost-competitive --
are going to fix it.

00:05:55.916 --> 00:05:57.076
In the future.

00:05:59.596 --> 00:06:04.076
I've spent 30 years running
environmental campaigns,